# Root of the npm workspace (family-quest-app + business-quest-app, see
# package.json's "workspaces") -- node_modules is hoisted here after the
# 2026-08 app split. Doesn't affect the unrelated game/ (Godot) project.
node_modules

# hellotoday-app/ (Android, Gradle build as of 2026-08-27; the old
# aapt2/d8/apksigner manual build.sh is gone):
hellotoday-app/.gradle/
hellotoday-app/app/build/
hellotoday-app/build/
# Machine-specific `sdk.dir=` pointer AGP reads instead of $ANDROID_HOME.
hellotoday-app/local.properties
# AGP's debug build type auto-generates/reuses ~/.android/debug.keystore
# per machine -- nothing to gitignore here for debug signing.
# Release (upload key) signing credentials -- NEVER commit these. The real
# .jks belongs outside this repo entirely; these patterns are a backstop in
# case one is ever dropped in here by mistake.
hellotoday-app/keystore.properties
hellotoday-app/*.jks
hellotoday-app/*.keystore

# The SDK Gradle/AGP resolves from Google's/Maven's servers over the
# network at build time (this repo doesn't vendor it) -- but AGP still
# needs local build-tools/platform jars for aapt2 etc. as a sibling of
# hellotoday-app/ (see app/build.gradle.kts's compileSdk/buildToolsVersion).
# ~300MB, fetched from the "android-sdk-slim" GitHub Release (see
# .github/workflows/fetch-android-sdk.yml) -- never commit it here.
/android-sdk/
